PulseCrawl research dataset inputs

Generators are adapted from PulseCrawl research tooling. WebBench is distributed as source. Software and adaptations remain under GNU AGPL version 3 only; the full license is included.

The pre-existing fixed HTML and site-pattern collections identify their original synthetic contents as CC0-1.0. That designation is preserved in their manifests. Other newly published files are AGPL-3.0-only unless a file states otherwise.

Real business names and product URLs occur only in the disabled live case-study plan. Generated inputs use fictional identities and do not represent real prices, actual jobs, factual news, permission to crawl, or affiliation.
